  "currency": "MKD",
  "vehicle_categories": ["passenger_car"],
  "description": "DRAFT, NOT APPROVED. North Macedonia import charges on a used passenger car (HS 8703, M1) per the fact sheet of 2026-10-13: customs duty (5% default; 0% only on an accepted preferential or US-origin proof), motor-vehicle tax (ДМВ: Table 1 value part on customs value + duty in EUR, Table 2 CO2 part per COC cycle, 400 g/km deemed when CO2 is not established, 50% for plug-in hybrids, BEV not subject) and 18% import VAT on customs value + duty + ДМВ + incidental costs. Not modelled: HS 8704 double-cab pick-ups, HS 9705 collector vehicles, oldtimer exemption (ЗДМВ чл. 17), other exemptions/refunds, customs processing fees (none found, UNCERTAIN), registration-stage fees. UNCERTAIN - confirm: rounding (0.01 MKD half-up vs whole denars), СКД = customs monthly EUR/MKD rate, ДМВ inside the VAT base, CO2 band edges and non-integer CO2, hybrid/PHEV fuel column, non-EU preferential list, US-origin evidence. Sources not yet hashed here: Customs Tariff law amendment 130/25 (final gazette text), Правилник 117/2009 (FX), Customs monthly FX list, Customs vehicle page (expired TLS, snippets only). Source sha256 values are of local research copies and must be re-verified at review.",
